Package: visualR
Type: Package
Title: Palindrome-Addressed Topological Runtime
Version: 0.1.1
Date: 2026-08-06
Authors@R:
    person("lkh-cq", given = NULL, email = "lkh-cq@users.noreply.github.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: lkh-cq [aut, cre]
Maintainer: lkh-cq <lkh-cq@users.noreply.github.com>
Description: A palindrome-addressed topological runtime with three-layer
    architecture: palindrome storage, matrix computation emergence,
    and projection view. v0.1 implements pure-R semantic correctness
    for PAL state construction, format/parse serialization, palindrome
    unfold/fold, jiugong grid mapping, diamond order field, frozen
    symmetry operators (complement C, central inversion Sigma), and
    validation. Zero external dependencies. v0.1.1 hardens serialization
    against arbitrary code execution (was eval(parse()) in v0.1.0).
